  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities as separate automata. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery only when needed and maximizing exploration otherwise. Recovery states are one-shot and only reached after obstacle events. All uncontrollable events are total in every state. The design avoids oscillations and ensures only one controllable is enabled per non-terminal state.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect hardware modularity and event separation.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-maximizing exploration with conservative, minimal recovery and rapid return to forward motion after clearance."
